    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        156.63470458984375,
        517.6172485351562,
        195.23361206054688
      ],
      "text": "Then they'll probably ask you what sorts of tasks you do for your mother\nduring the day. Things like if she needs help with getting dressed, for example.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        208.0520477294922,
        128.062255859375,
        227.55343627929688
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        228.1547088623047,
        483.382080078125,
        266.87359619140625
      ],
      "text": "Right. I help her with that. And also I help her get into the shower in the\nmorning.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        279.6920471191406,
        105.86299896240234,
        299.1934509277344
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        299.793701171875,
        200.8192596435547,
        318.5926208496094
      ],
      "text": "Yes, that sort of thing.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        331.4110412597656,
        128.062255859375,
        350.9124450683594
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        351.5146789550781,
        521.0520629882812,
        390.2336120605469
      ],
      "text": "Yes, that's becoming a bit of a problem. She used to be very good at it, but not\nanymore.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        403.23468017578125,
        498.3727111816406,
        441.3137512207031
      ],
      "text": "Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at\nquestions five to ten. Now listen and answer questions 5 to 10.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        454.7710266113281,
        105.86299896240234,
        474.2724304199219
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        474.87469482421875,
        510.7311706542969,
        513.4735717773438
      ],
      "text": "And be ready to tell them about anything you find particularly difficult about\ncaring for your mother.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        526.4110107421875,
        128.062255859375,
        545.9124145507812
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        546.3937377929688,
        504.29473876953125,
        605.0336303710938
      ],
      "text": "So, recently I've noticed she's started to have quite bad problems with her\nmemory. If I wasn't there, I think she'd forget to eat, for example. And often\nshe doesn't seem quite sure what day\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        617.85205078125,
        105.86299896240234,
        637.3534545898438
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        637.834716796875,
        490.4613342285156,
        676.5526123046875
      ],
      "text": "Yes, tell them about that. And are there any physical difficulties you have\ncaring for her? Lifting her, for example?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        689.4920654296875,
        128.062255859375,
        708.9934692382812
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        709.4747314453125,
        523.0441284179688,
        748.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "Yes, she's quite heavy and I'm afraid of hurting my back. I'd be in real trouble if\nthat happened.\n"
    }
